      "id": 3,
      "text": "The 1703 Sebastián Martín Land Grant gave Hispano settlers vast riverbank tracts, shaping Canova's early Spanish colonial layout.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
